# Accepted security findings, each with a reason. Reviewed: 2026-10-02.

# AWS-0104: worker-node security group allows all outbound traffic.
# Nodes must pull images from ghcr.io and Docker Hub (via the NAT gateway). Restricting
# egress needs VPC endpoints for AWS services plus an egress proxy/firewall for public
# registries: out of scope for this demo. Revisit before running real workloads.
